### ====================================================================
### HESTA Smart Home - Sliding Gate IoT & MQTT Test Suite
### ====================================================================
### Cấu hình thiết bị theo ESP32-CAM AI-Thinker:
### - Node ID:   8d1cdd82-b339-469e-be13-7e91070f7ae5
### - Device ID: 2d566d0a-f7d6-4fac-a0bf-18912da4ab28
### - Topics:
###   + Command:   hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
###   + State:     hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/state
###   + Telemetry: hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/telemetry
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deviceId = 2d566d0a-f7d6-4fac-a0bf-18912da4ab28
@nodeId = 8d1cdd82-b339-469e-be13-7e91070f7ae5
@token = 

### ====================================================================
