### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 1: ĐIỀU KHIỂN CỔNG QUA CHUYÊN BIỆT GATE CONTROLLER API
### Endpoint Base: /api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/...
### ====================================================================

### 1.1 Lệnh MỞ CỔNG (OPEN) qua shortcut endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/open
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.2 Lệnh ĐÓNG CỔNG (CLOSE) qua shortcut endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/close
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.3 Lệnh DỪNG CỔNG (STOP) qua shortcut endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/stop
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.4 Gửi lệnh qua endpoint Gate Command (Action: OPEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "OPEN"
}

### 1.5 Gửi lệnh qua endpoint Gate Command (Action: CLOSE kèm chỉ định Node ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CLOSE",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### 1.6 Gửi lệnh qua endpoint Gate Command (Action: STOP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "STOP"
}

### 1.7 Lấy trạng thái hiện tại của cổng (State, Limit Switch Open/Close)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/state
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 2: ĐIỀU KHIỂN CỔNG QUA GENERIC DEVICE COMMAND API
### Endpoint Base: POST /api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
### ====================================================================

### 2.1 Generic Command - OPEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "OPEN"
}

### 2.2 Generic Command - CLOSE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CLOSE"
}

### 2.3 Generic Command - STOP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "STOP"
}


### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 3: KIỂM TRA THÔNG TIN THIẾT BỊ VÀ LỊCH SỬ TRẠNG THÁI (NẾU ĐÃ LƯU DB)
### ====================================================================

### 3.1 Xem chi tiết thiết bị
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 Xem lịch sử thay đổi trạng thái (OPEN, CLOSING, STOPPED,...)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/history
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 4: KIỂM TRA VALIDATION VÀ XỬ LÝ LỖI (EXPECTED 400 BAD REQUEST)
### ====================================================================

### 4.1 Lỗi: Action không hợp lệ (Ví dụ: "FLY" -> Expected HTTP 400 GATE_ACTION_INVALID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "FLY"
}

### 4.2 Lỗi: Action bị bỏ trống (Expected HTTP 400 INVALID_DEVICE_ACTION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/gate/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": ""
}
